//ItemDisplay[RARE !ID ETH (tax OR 9ta OR 7ta OR bkf OR 9bk OR 7bk OR bal OR 9b8 OR 7b8 OR glv OR 9gl OR 7gl OR tsp OR 9ts OR 7ts OR ssp OR 9s9 OR 7s7 OR pil OR 9pi OR 7pi)]:%WHITE%Eth %YELLOW%%NAME%%MAP-0B%%DOT-6A%%PX-20%%TIER-0%//

